chx:X_SampleHighR a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:SampleHighR ; rdfs:label "R begins with 0x88"@en ; skos:definition "The sample's R has its top bit set, which costs a padding zero and one extra byte, while its s is the low form."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/research> .
